        "id": 1416371
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-03T22:22:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe it would make sense to have `jump_to_payload_with_efi_stub` take a `\u0026[u8]` to avoid most of the `unsafe` instances? The caller has knowledge about `payload_start` and `payload_size` and could construct it there.",
      "revId": "4018b2f37c7dc1dc2ba099cad3ab7a9d3792cfb9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
