      "message": "Knowing that `pe_header` points to a usable memory location depends on `jump_to_payload_with_efi_stub` having a constraint on `payload_start`. This means that `jump_to_payload_with_efi_stub` must be unsafe and document its requirements.",
      "revId": "4018b2f37c7dc1dc2ba099cad3ab7a9d3792cfb9",
